<title>UK: Bayerische Vereinsbank to launch global Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Bayerische Vereinsbank to launch global Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank will launch a self-led global Pfandbrief of up to 2.0 billion marks, the bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch is joint lead manager for the transaction, expected to have a five-year maturity.</p>
<p>There will be investor presentations in the U.S., Asia and Europe and launch is expected in two weeks time.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
